msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "While daggers don’t do the kind of damage that a sword or an axe can deliver, they are very quick—sometimes letting you get two attacks for every one of your slower opponents'.  Expert dagger fighters can wield a dagger in their left hand while using another weapon in their right.  Master dagger fighters have a chance of doing a triple damage attack."
msgstr "While daggers don稚 do the kind of damage that a sword or an axe can deliver, they are very quick耀ometimes letting you get two attacks for every one of your slower opponents'.  Expert dagger fighters can wield a dagger in their left hand while using another weapon in their right.  Master dagger fighters have a chance of doing a triple damage attack."

