msgid "This spell surrounds its target with the power of raw darkness, rendering it unable to fire missile attacks or cast spells. Further the target's movement is slowed, its armor class is halved and it does half damage when striking in melee combat."
msgstr "狙った敵を真っ暗な闇で包み、飛び道具や呪文を使えなくする。さらに、標的は動きが鈍り、アーマークラスと接近戦用の武器のダメージが半分になる。"

