msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:209
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Scroll.txt.py:45
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "Here is the key to the combination door you requested.\n\nA.  Trap.\nB.  Opens door 4 and closes door 5.\nC.  Opens door 5 and closes door 4.\nD.  Opens door 1 and closes door 5.\nE.  Opens door 5 and closes door 1.\nF.  Opens door 2 and closes door 4.\nG.  Opens door 6.\nH.  Opens door 3 and closes door 2.\nI.    Opens door 2 and closes door 3.\nJ.   Opens door 2 and closes door 1.\nK.  Opens door 6 and closes door 5.\nL.   Opens door 3 and closes door 4.\nM.  Maintenance.\nN.  Opens door 1 and closes door 2.\nO.  Opens door 5 and closes door 6.\nP.  Reset.  \n\nSincerely, the Drawkcab Monks."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:210
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Scroll.txt.py:46
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "The ritual described on this scroll seems to be a complex magical formula requiring the caster to face the target from a distance and follow a lengthy and exacting series of steps.  You can't figure out what the effect of the spell will be once it's been cast."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:211
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Scroll.txt.py:47
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "I have hidden this letter here hoping it will be found by someone loyal to the Crown.  That I am even able to write it is a miracle--my captors were too stupid to take my writing materials--and I need many more miracles to survive this predicament.  All of my men were lost in the battle against the devils, leaving only Tanir, Ragnar, and myself alive.  Lord Ragnar is in a bad way, and I fear he will not survive the night.  Better for him, perhaps.  Since we have not yet been killed, I'm guessing we are being saved for something special.  Whatever it is, as long as there is life, there is hope.  They will probably carry Tanir and I from this awful place to another awful place to ransom us or torture us for information.  Whatever our fate, you, my loyal subject, must work to ensure the survival of the kingdom and our world.  These devils are a threat much worse than Archibald ever was, and will require the most desperate measures to defeat.  Take those measures, even if it means releasing my evil brother from his tomb of stone.  Above all, seek the advice of the Oracle in Free Haven.  I hear my captors coming down the hall!  Tell my wife and son I love them, and DON'T TRUST SULMAN! He is a traitor.  Good Luck!  --Roland Ironfist, King of Enroth   "
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:212
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Scroll.txt.py:48
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "Congratulations!  I hereby proclaim you all Super-Goobers!"
msgstr ""

