#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:364
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "All ArcoMage games here start with each player having a Tower of 20 and a Wall of 10.\nThe object is to get to either a Tower of 150, one of the resources to 400, or to destroy your opponent's Tower."
msgstr "All ArcoMage games here start with each player having a Tower of 20 and a Wall of 10.  The object is to get to either a Tower of 150, one of the resources to 400, or to destroy your opponent's Tower."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1270
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:365
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "All ArcoMage games here start with each player having a Tower of 20 and a Wall of 10.\nThe object is to get to either a Tower of 200, one of the resources to 500, or to destroy your opponent's Tower."
msgstr "All ArcoMage games here start with each player having a Tower of 20 and a Wall of 10.  The object is to get to either a Tower of 200, one of the resources to 500, or to destroy your opponent's Tower."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1271
