#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1337
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:432
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "With Grand Master Dark Magic you can learn all of the Grand Master spells for this element.\nHigher Level spells may prove more potent and of greater assistance to your party.\nGrand Master Dark Magic can be yours if you have a Master skill level of 10 in Dark Magic, have completed either the Lich or Priest of Dark promotion quests and can pay the price of 8000 gold."
msgstr "With Grand Master Dark Magic you can learn all of the Grand Master spells for this element.  Higher Level spells may prove more potent and of greater assistance to your party.  Grand Master Dark Magic can be yours if you have a Master skill level of 10 in Dark Magic, have completed either the Lich or Priest of Dark promotion quests and can pay the price of 8000 gold."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1339
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:434
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Wands, scrolls, rings and potions can be important items, and not knowing what they are is just foolishness.\nWith Mastery of the Identify Items skill you can attempt to identify weapons, armor, and other miscellaneous items.\nFor a small fee of 2500 gold and demonstration of an Expert Skill level of 7, I can teach you Mastery of the Identify Items Skill."
msgstr "Wands, scrolls, rings and potions can be important items, and not knowing what they are is just foolishness.  With Mastery of the Identify Items skill you can attempt to identify weapons, armor, and other miscellaneous items.  For a small fee of 2500 gold and demonstration of an Expert Skill level of 7, I can teach you Mastery of the Identify Items Skill."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1340
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:435
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Found and ancient item or relic and don’t know what it does or what its for.\nIgnorance in the case is not bliss, in fact it could very well kill. With Grand Mastery of the Identify Item Skill you can attempt to identify anything you have found including artifacts and relics.\nA Master Skill level of 10 and 6000 gold is all that is required to learn this Skill."
msgstr "Found and ancient item or relic and don稚 know what it does or what its for.  Ignorance in the case is not bliss, in fact it could very well kill. With Grand Mastery of the Identify Item Skill you can attempt to identify anything you have found including artifacts and relics.  A Master Skill level of 10 and 6000 gold is all that is required to learn this Skill."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1341
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:436
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Shop owners are a greedy lot.\nWant to get better prices for what you buy and sell?\nThen you better have the Merchant Skill and fast. I can teach you the Expertise of the Merchant Skill if you have a skill level of 4 and pay 2000 gold.\nExpertise doubles your bonus towards prices."
msgstr "Shop owners are a greedy lot.  Want to get better prices for what you buy and sell?  Then you better have the Merchant Skill and fast. I can teach you the Expertise of the Merchant Skill if you have a skill level of 4 and pay 2000 gold.  Expertise doubles your bonus towards prices."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1342
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:437
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Shop owners are a greedy lot.\nWant to get better prices for what you buy and sell?\nThen you better have the Merchant Skill and learn the ins and outs of trading. I can teach you Mastery of the Merchant Skill if you have an Expert Skill level of 7, a Personality of 50 and pay 5000 gold.\nMastery triples your bonus towards prices."
msgstr "Shop owners are a greedy lot.  Want to get better prices for what you buy and sell?  Then you better have the Merchant Skill and learn the ins and outs of trading. I can teach you Mastery of the Merchant Skill if you have an Expert Skill level of 7, a Personality of 50 and pay 5000 gold.  Mastery triples your bonus towards prices."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1343
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:438
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Shop owners are a greedy lot.\nWant to get better prices for what you buy and sell?\nThen you better have the Merchant Skill and learn the ins and outs of trading. I can teach you Grand Mastery of the Merchant Skill if you have a Master Skill level of 10 and pay 8000 gold.\nGrand Mastery allows you to pay and receive the actual price for goods."
msgstr "Shop owners are a greedy lot.  Want to get better prices for what you buy and sell?  Then you better have the Merchant Skill and learn the ins and outs of trading. I can teach you Grand Mastery of the Merchant Skill if you have a Master Skill level of 10 and pay 8000 gold.  Grand Mastery allows you to pay and receive the actual price for goods."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1344
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:439
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your equipment is only as good as the person who repairs it.\nIf you can't fix it, you could find yourself stuck in the wilderness with no armor or weapons.\nThis could be extraordinarily bad. Expertise with the Repair Item skill allows you not only the chance of repairing weapons, but armor as well.\nThis skill can be yours if you have a Skill level of 4 and pay 500 gold."
msgstr "Your equipment is only as good as the person who repairs it.  If you can't fix it, you could find yourself stuck in the wilderness with no armor or weapons.  This could be extraordinarily bad. Expertise with the Repair Item skill allows you not only the chance of repairing weapons, but armor as well.  This skill can be yours if you have a Skill level of 4 and pay 500 gold."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1345
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:440
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your equipment is only as good as the person who repairs it.\nIf you can't fix it, you could find yourself stuck in the wilderness with no armor or weapons.\nThis could be extraordinarily bad. Mastery of the Repair Item skill allows you not only the chance of repairing weapons and armor any broken miscellaneous item as well.\nThis skill can be yours if you have an Expert Skill level of 7 and pay 2500 gold."
msgstr "Your equipment is only as good as the person who repairs it.  If you can't fix it, you could find yourself stuck in the wilderness with no armor or weapons.  This could be extraordinarily bad. Mastery of the Repair Item skill allows you not only the chance of repairing weapons and armor any broken miscellaneous item as well.  This skill can be yours if you have an Expert Skill level of 7 and pay 2500 gold."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1346
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:441
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your equipment is only as good as the person who repairs it.\nIf you can't fix it, you could find yourself stuck in the wilderness with no armor or weapons.\nThis could be extraordinarily bad. A Grand Master of the Repair Items Skill can fix ANYTHING that is broken.\nThis skill can be yours if you have a Master Skill level of 10 and pay 6000 gold."
msgstr "Your equipment is only as good as the person who repairs it.  If you can't fix it, you could find yourself stuck in the wilderness with no armor or weapons.  This could be extraordinarily bad. A Grand Master of the Repair Items Skill can fix ANYTHING that is broken.  This skill can be yours if you have a Master Skill level of 10 and pay 6000 gold."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1347
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:442
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So you think you are adventurers, do you?\nThere's not enough meat on you to protect you from the slap of a baby goblin!\nBody Building is the only way to go.\nYou will be stronger and tougher than before!\nAn Expert of Body Building is tougher than the normal hero.\nI can teach you this if your skill level is 4, pay 500 gold and are ready to sweat!"
msgstr "So you think you are adventurers, do you?  There's not enough meat on you to protect you from the slap of a baby goblin!  Body Building is the only way to go.  You will be stronger and tougher than before!  An Expert of Body Building is tougher than the normal hero.  I can teach you this if your skill level is 4, pay 500 gold and are ready to sweat!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1348
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:443
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So you think you are adventurers, do you?\nThere's not enough meat on you to protect you from the slap of a baby troll!\nBody Building is the only way to go.\nYou will be stronger and tougher than before!\nA Master of Body Building is much tougher than the average hero.\nI can teach you this if your Expert Skill level is 7, pay 2500 gold and have and Endurance of 50! No pain no gain!"
msgstr "So you think you are adventurers, do you?  There's not enough meat on you to protect you from the slap of a baby troll!  Body Building is the only way to go.  You will be stronger and tougher than before!  A Master of Body Building is much tougher than the average hero.  I can teach you this if your Expert Skill level is 7, pay 2500 gold and have and Endurance of 50! No pain no gain!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1349
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:444
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So you think you are adventurers, do you?\nThere's not enough meat on you to protect you from the slap of a baby dragon!\nBody Building is the only way to go.\nYou will be stronger and tougher than before!\nA Grand Master of Body Building is the toughest hero you can find.\nI can teach you this if your Master Skill level is 9, pay 6000 gold and have and Endurance of 50! No pain no gain!"
msgstr "So you think you are adventurers, do you?  There's not enough meat on you to protect you from the slap of a baby dragon!  Body Building is the only way to go.  You will be stronger and tougher than before!  A Grand Master of Body Building is the toughest hero you can find.  I can teach you this if your Master Skill level is 9, pay 6000 gold and have and Endurance of 50! No pain no gain!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1350
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:445
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Not enough spell points for casting those Expert spells?\nMeditation is what you need.\nWith an Expert Skill in Meditation you get a double bonus to your available spell points.\nThis could mean one more powerful spell when you most need it!\nExpertise can be yours if your skill level is 4 and pay me 500 gold."
msgstr "Not enough spell points for casting those Expert spells?  Meditation is what you need.  With an Expert Skill in Meditation you get a double bonus to your available spell points.  This could mean one more powerful spell when you most need it!  Expertise can be yours if your skill level is 4 and pay me 500 gold."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1351
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:446
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Not enough spell points for casting those Master spells?\nMeditation is what you need.\nWith a Master Skill in Meditation you get a triple bonus to your available spell points.\nThis could mean one more powerful spell when you most need it!\nMastery can be yours if your Expert Skill level is 7 and pay me 2500 gold."
msgstr "Not enough spell points for casting those Master spells?  Meditation is what you need.  With a Master Skill in Meditation you get a triple bonus to your available spell points.  This could mean one more powerful spell when you most need it!  Mastery can be yours if your Expert Skill level is 7 and pay me 2500 gold."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1352
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:447
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Not enough spell points for casting those Grand Master spells?\nMeditation is what you need.\nWith a Grand Master Skill in Meditation you get a quadruple bonus to your available spell points.\nThis could mean one or more powerful spells when you most need them!\nGrand Mastery can be yours if your Master Skill level is 10 and pay me 6000 gold."
msgstr "Not enough spell points for casting those Grand Master spells?  Meditation is what you need.  With a Grand Master Skill in Meditation you get a quadruple bonus to your available spell points.  This could mean one or more powerful spells when you most need them!  Grand Mastery can be yours if your Master Skill level is 10 and pay me 6000 gold."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1353
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:448
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Things are sometime hidden in the dungeons and castles of this land.\n You may have missed something without even knowing it was there.\nPerception increases your chance of finding these hidden things. Expertise in the Perception skill doubles your chances of finding these hidden things.\nFor 500 gold and a skill level of 4 in Perception, I will teach you."
msgstr "Things are sometime hidden in the dungeons and castles of this land.   You may have missed something without even knowing it was there.  Perception increases your chance of finding these hidden things. Expertise in the Perception skill doubles your chances of finding these hidden things.  For 500 gold and a skill level of 4 in Perception, I will teach you."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1354
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:449
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Things are sometime hidden in the dungeons and castles of this land.\n You may have missed something without even knowing it was there.\nPerception increases your chance of finding these hidden things. Mastery of the Perception skill triples your chances of finding these hidden things.\nFor 2500 gold and an Expert skill level of 7 in Perception, I will teach you."
msgstr "Things are sometime hidden in the dungeons and castles of this land.   You may have missed something without even knowing it was there.  Perception increases your chance of finding these hidden things. Mastery of the Perception skill triples your chances of finding these hidden things.  For 2500 gold and an Expert skill level of 7 in Perception, I will teach you."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1355
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:450
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Things are sometime hidden in the dungeons and castles of this land.\nYou may have missed something without even knowing it was there.\nPerception increases your chance of finding these hidden things. Grand Mastery of the Perception skill quintuples your chances of finding these hidden things. For 6000 gold and a Master Skill level of 10 in Perception, I will teach you."
msgstr "Things are sometime hidden in the dungeons and castles of this land.  You may have missed something without even knowing it was there.  Perception increases your chance of finding these hidden things. Grand Mastery of the Perception skill quintuples your chances of finding these hidden things. For 6000 gold and a Master Skill level of 10 in Perception, I will teach you."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1356
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My brother, Elron, was an avid Arcomage player.\nHave you played Arcomage yet?\nHorribly addicting game, if I do say so.\nIn any rate, you can only play if you have a deck, and decks are hard to come by… so I guess you probably haven't.\nIn any case, Elron wanted to go over some strategies to help him win more games.\nUnfortunately, he didn't want to be in town because he didn't want anyone else to spy on him learn his tricks so he went to the White Cliff Caves southeast a bit from town.Elron hasn't been back in almost a week.\nI'm certain something horrible has happened to him, but if he's alive I'd like to know that too.\nWould you do me the service of locating him?\nI don't have a lot of money to pay you back with, but I'd be greatly in your debt."
msgstr "My brother, Elron, was an avid Arcomage player.  Have you played Arcomage yet?  Horribly addicting game, if I do say so.  In any rate, you can only play if you have a deck, and decks are hard to come by� so I guess you probably haven't.  In any case, Elron wanted to go over some strategies to help him win more games.  Unfortunately, he didn't want to be in town because he didn't want anyone else to spy on him learn his tricks so he went to the White Cliff Caves southeast a bit from town.\n\nElron hasn't been back in almost a week.  I'm certain something horrible has happened to him, but if he's alive I'd like to know that too.  Would you do me the service of locating him?  I don't have a lot of money to pay you back with, but I'd be greatly in your debt."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1357
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:452
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Still no sign of him?\nI understand.\nIf you do happen to find out what happened to him, please let me know."
msgstr "Still no sign of him?  I understand.  If you do happen to find out what happened to him, please let me know."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1358
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:453
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Dead?\nOh dear!\nThose are certainly his cards, though.\nI don't want the cards; you can have them-- that game has cost me enough now.\nOh, poor Elron!\nI have a little money you can keep for your help, and thank you for finding out what happened to Elron."
msgstr "Dead?  Oh dear!  Those are certainly his cards, though.  I don't want the cards; you can have them-- that game has cost me enough now.  Oh, poor Elron!  I have a little money you can keep for your help, and thank you for finding out what happened to Elron."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1359
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:454
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The School of Sorcery here in the Bracada Desert collects a number of odd magical paraphernalia.\nA few years ago an item of particular interest was stolen from the School by raiders from Deyja.\nThis item, the Seasons' Stole, was worn by Priests of the Sun during religious ceremonies at the turn of the seasons.\nAs a representative of the School of Sorcery, I'm authorized to reward you for its return.\nOur last information placed the stolen Stole in the Hall of the Pit; I would suggest checking there first."
msgstr "The School of Sorcery here in the Bracada Desert collects a number of odd magical paraphernalia.  A few years ago an item of particular interest was stolen from the School by raiders from Deyja.  This item, the Seasons' Stole, was worn by Priests of the Sun during religious ceremonies at the turn of the seasons.  As a representative of the School of Sorcery, I'm authorized to reward you for its return.  Our last information placed the stolen Stole in the Hall of the Pit; I would suggest checking there first."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1360
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:455
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Don't forget there is a reward for the Seasons' Stole if you are able to find it and return it to me."
msgstr "Don't forget there is a reward for the Seasons' Stole if you are able to find it and return it to me."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1361
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:456
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Excellent!\nThis most certainly is the Seasons' Stole.\nHere is your reward; you've done both the School of Sorcery and myself a great service."
msgstr "Excellent!  This most certainly is the Seasons' Stole.  Here is your reward; you've done both the School of Sorcery and myself a great service."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1362
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:457
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Tired of chests blowing up in your face?\nSick of poison gas clouds, fireballs, and lightning bolts sending party members to the Great Beyond?\nExpert Lock Picking doubles your chance of disarming these traps before they go off.\nI will teach you Expert Lock Picking if you have a Skill level of 4 and can pay 500 gold."
msgstr "Tired of chests blowing up in your face?  Sick of poison gas clouds, fireballs, and lightning bolts sending party members to the Great Beyond?  Expert Lock Picking doubles your chance of disarming these traps before they go off.  I will teach you Expert Lock Picking if you have a Skill level of 4 and can pay 500 gold."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1363
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:458
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Tired of chests blowing up in your face?\nSick of poison gas clouds, fireballs, and lightning bolts sending party members to the Great Beyond?\nMaster Lock Picking triples your chance of disarming these traps before they go off.\nI will teach you Master Lock Picking if you have an Expert Skill level of 7 and can pay 2500 gold."
msgstr "Tired of chests blowing up in your face?  Sick of poison gas clouds, fireballs, and lightning bolts sending party members to the Great Beyond?  Master Lock Picking triples your chance of disarming these traps before they go off.  I will teach you Master Lock Picking if you have an Expert Skill level of 7 and can pay 2500 gold."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1364
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:459
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Tired of chests blowing up in your face?\nSick of poison gas clouds, fireballs, and lightning bolts sending party members to the Great Beyond?\nGrand Master Lock Picking eliminates these pesky traps entirely before they go off.\nI will teach you Grand Master Lock Picking if you have a Master Skill level of 10 and can pay 6000 gold."
msgstr "Tired of chests blowing up in your face?  Sick of poison gas clouds, fireballs, and lightning bolts sending party members to the Great Beyond?  Grand Master Lock Picking eliminates these pesky traps entirely before they go off.  I will teach you Grand Master Lock Picking if you have a Master Skill level of 10 and can pay 6000 gold."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1365
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:460
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The best defense to an attack is not to be there when the attack is made.\nOf course you must be quick and agile to do this, and wear no armor. While your Dodging skill makes you that more difficult to hit, this bonus is doubled when you have learned my Expert teachings.\nI will instruct you if you have a Skill level of 4 in Dodging and pay 2000 gold."
msgstr "The best defense to an attack is not to be there when the attack is made.  Of course you must be quick and agile to do this, and wear no armor. While your Dodging skill makes you that more difficult to hit, this bonus is doubled when you have learned my Expert teachings.  I will instruct you if you have a Skill level of 4 in Dodging and pay 2000 gold."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1366
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:461
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The best defense to an attack is not to be there when the attack is made.\nOf course you must be quick and agile to do this, and wear no armor. While your Dodging skill makes you that more difficult to hit, this bonus is tripled when you have learned Mastery of dodging.\nI will instruct you if you have an Expert Skill level of 7 in Dodging and pay 5000 gold"
msgstr "The best defense to an attack is not to be there when the attack is made.  Of course you must be quick and agile to do this, and wear no armor. While your Dodging skill makes you that more difficult to hit, this bonus is tripled when you have learned Mastery of dodging.  I will instruct you if you have an Expert Skill level of 7 in Dodging and pay 5000 gold"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1367
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:462
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The best defense to an attack is not to be there when the attack is made.\nOf course you must be quick and agile to do this, and wear no armor. Or so you thought, for Grand Mastery gives you all of the benefits of Dodging while wearing leather armor. Your Dodging skill makes you that much more difficult to hit and this bonus is still tripled when you have achieved Grand Mastery of Dodging.\nI will instruct you if you have a Master Skill level of 10 in Dodging, pay 8000 gold and skill level of 10 in Unarmed combat."
msgstr "The best defense to an attack is not to be there when the attack is made.  Of course you must be quick and agile to do this, and wear no armor. Or so you thought, for Grand Mastery gives you all of the benefits of Dodging while wearing leather armor. Your Dodging skill makes you that much more difficult to hit and this bonus is still tripled when you have achieved Grand Mastery of Dodging.  I will instruct you if you have a Master Skill level of 10 in Dodging, pay 8000 gold and skill level of 10 in Unarmed combat."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1368
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:463
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hand to hand combat is the quickest way to fight.\nNo weapons to slow you down. With my Expert teachings you will learn to do more damage with every hit you land upon your enemy. You must have a skill level of 4 in Unarmed combat and pay my price of 2000 gold."
msgstr "Hand to hand combat is the quickest way to fight.  No weapons to slow you down. With my Expert teachings you will learn to do more damage with every hit you land upon your enemy. You must have a skill level of 4 in Unarmed combat and pay my price of 2000 gold."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1369
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:464
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You wish to continue upon the path of Mastery of Unarmed combat?\nWith Mastery you will double your bonus to hit and damage with every attack.\nFirst you must have an Expert skill level of 7 with Unarmed combat and pay 5000 gold.\nOnly then will I teach you."
msgstr "You wish to continue upon the path of Mastery of Unarmed combat?  With Mastery you will double your bonus to hit and damage with every attack.  First you must have an Expert skill level of 7 with Unarmed combat and pay 5000 gold.  Only then will I teach you."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1370
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:465
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Attaining Grand Master level of Unarmed combat gives you the chance to avoid attacks entirely, leaving you unhampered to slay your foe.\nYou must demonstrate a Master skill level of 10 in Unarmed combat, a skill level of 10 in Dodging and pay 8000 gold to receive my instruction."
msgstr "Attaining Grand Master level of Unarmed combat gives you the chance to avoid attacks entirely, leaving you unhampered to slay your foe.  You must demonstrate a Master skill level of 10 in Unarmed combat, a skill level of 10 in Dodging and pay 8000 gold to receive my instruction."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1371
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:466
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Knowing what you are up against in combat can mean the difference between life and death.\nBeing able to identify the monsters and opponents you are fighting can make this difference. I can teach you Expert Identify Monster if you already have a skill level of 4 and and pay 500 gold."
msgstr "Knowing what you are up against in combat can mean the difference between life and death.  Being able to identify the monsters and opponents you are fighting can make this difference. I can teach you Expert Identify Monster if you already have a skill level of 4 and and pay 500 gold."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1372
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:467
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "He who runs away today lives to run away another day.\nThis doesn't necessarily mean he is a coward, however.\nHe may just be very smart.\nHe may know how his opponent attacks and what spells he may use, if any.\nI can teach you Master Identify Monster if you have achieved an Expert Skill level of 7 and can pay 2500 gold."
msgstr "He who runs away today lives to run away another day.  This doesn't necessarily mean he is a coward, however.  He may just be very smart.  He may know how his opponent attacks and what spells he may use, if any.  I can teach you Master Identify Monster if you have achieved an Expert Skill level of 7 and can pay 2500 gold."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1373
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:468
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you can probe your enemies defenses and know his weaknesses, you will always prevail.\nWith Grand Mastery of Identify Monster, you will know how your enemy attacks and what his defenses are.\nThis knowledge will allow you to attack his weakest points. I can raise you to Grand Master of this skill if you have a Master skill level of 10 and pay 6000 gold."
msgstr "If you can probe your enemies defenses and know his weaknesses, you will always prevail.  With Grand Mastery of Identify Monster, you will know how your enemy attacks and what his defenses are.  This knowledge will allow you to attack his weakest points. I can raise you to Grand Master of this skill if you have a Master skill level of 10 and pay 6000 gold."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1374
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:469
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Knowledge of a single weapon is great.\nHaving knowledge of all weapons is even better.\nArmsmaster skill allows you to decrease the recovery time of any melee weapon you are already skilled with and gives the chance for greater inflicted damage.\nI can make you an Expert Armsmaster if you have a skill level of 4 and pay 2000 gold."
msgstr "Knowledge of a single weapon is great.  Having knowledge of all weapons is even better.  Armsmaster skill allows you to decrease the recovery time of any melee weapon you are already skilled with and gives the chance for greater inflicted damage.  I can make you an Expert Armsmaster if you have a skill level of 4 and pay 2000 gold."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1375
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:470
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Knowledge of a single melee weapon is great.\nHaving knowledge of all melee weapons is even better.\nArmsmaster skill allows you to decrease the recovery time of any melee weapon you are already skilled with and gives the chance for greater inflicted damage.\nI can make you a Master Armsmaster if you have an Expert skill level of 7 and pay 5000 gold."
msgstr "Knowledge of a single melee weapon is great.  Having knowledge of all melee weapons is even better.  Armsmaster skill allows you to decrease the recovery time of any melee weapon you are already skilled with and gives the chance for greater inflicted damage.  I can make you a Master Armsmaster if you have an Expert skill level of 7 and pay 5000 gold."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1376
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:471
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Knowledge of a single melee weapon is great.\nHaving knowledge of all melee weapons is even better.\nArmsmaster skill decreases the recovery time of any melee weapon you are already skilled with and gives the chance for greater inflicted damage.\nI can make you a Grand Master Armsmaster if you have a Master skill level of 10 and pay 8000 gold."
msgstr "Knowledge of a single melee weapon is great.  Having knowledge of all melee weapons is even better.  Armsmaster skill decreases the recovery time of any melee weapon you are already skilled with and gives the chance for greater inflicted damage.  I can make you a Grand Master Armsmaster if you have a Master skill level of 10 and pay 8000 gold."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1377
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:472
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Don’t want to pay for an item from a store?\nThe five finger discount gives you a chance to to take an item without paying for it.\nI can teach you Expert Stealing for 500 gold and if your skill level is already 4.\nThis will double you chance of success!"
msgstr "Don稚 want to pay for an item from a store?  The five finger discount gives you a chance to to take an item without paying for it.  I can teach you Expert Stealing for 500 gold and if your skill level is already 4.  This will double you chance of success!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1378
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:473
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Just a little short on gold?\nOr do you think that free is always better than having to pay?\nIf you already have an Expert Skill level of 7 in Stealing and pay me 2500 gold, I can teach you ways of Master Stealing, tripling you chances of success while stealing!"
msgstr "Just a little short on gold?  Or do you think that free is always better than having to pay?  If you already have an Expert Skill level of 7 in Stealing and pay me 2500 gold, I can teach you ways of Master Stealing, tripling you chances of success while stealing!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1379
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:474
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Want to keep all that hard earned gold, do you?\nDon’t want to have to pay to replace that broken item you can't repair? As a Grand Master of Stealing I can teach you ways to quintuple your chances of success when stealing.\nYou must already have a Master skill level of 10 and pay me 6000 gold!"
msgstr "Want to keep all that hard earned gold, do you?  Don稚 want to have to pay to replace that broken item you can't repair? As a Grand Master of Stealing I can teach you ways to quintuple your chances of success when stealing.  You must already have a Master skill level of 10 and pay me 6000 gold!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1382
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:477
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The black potion is the Alchemist's ultimate creation!\nThey can effect so many different things and are even wonderful to taste!\nGrand Mastery of Alchemy can be yours if you have a Master skill level of 10 in Alchemy, possess one of each of the best reagents and pay 6000 gold."
msgstr "The black potion is the Alchemist's ultimate creation!  They can effect so many different things and are even wonderful to taste!  Grand Mastery of Alchemy can be yours if you have a Master skill level of 10 in Alchemy, possess one of each of the best reagents and pay 6000 gold."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1383
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:478
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Learning allows you to gain more experience from your travels and encounters. Expert Learning doubles the bonus to gained experience, leading you down the path of greater wisdom.\nI will instruct you in Expert Learning if your Skill level is 4 and you pay me 2000 gold."
msgstr "Learning allows you to gain more experience from your travels and encounters. Expert Learning doubles the bonus to gained experience, leading you down the path of greater wisdom.  I will instruct you in Expert Learning if your Skill level is 4 and you pay me 2000 gold."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1384
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:479
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Learning allows you to gain more experience from your travels and encounters. Master Learning triples the bonus to gained experience, leading you down the path of greater wisdom.\nI will instruct you in Master Learning if you have an Expert Skill level of 7, pay me 5000 gold and have and Intellect of 50."
msgstr "Learning allows you to gain more experience from your travels and encounters. Master Learning triples the bonus to gained experience, leading you down the path of greater wisdom.  I will instruct you in Master Learning if you have an Expert Skill level of 7, pay me 5000 gold and have and Intellect of 50."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1385
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:480
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Learning allows you to gain more experience from your travels and encounters. Grand Master Learning quintuples the bonus to gained experience, leading you down the path of greater wisdom.\nI will instruct you in Grand Master Learning if you have a Master Skill level of 10, pay me 8000 gold and have and Intellect of 50."
msgstr "Learning allows you to gain more experience from your travels and encounters. Grand Master Learning quintuples the bonus to gained experience, leading you down the path of greater wisdom.  I will instruct you in Grand Master Learning if you have a Master Skill level of 10, pay me 8000 gold and have and Intellect of 50."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1386
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:481
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thomas Grey runs the School of Sorcery.\nIf you're looking for promotion to Wizard or Honorary Wizard, he's your man.\nHis room is right through the door behind me."
msgstr "Thomas Grey runs the School of Sorcery.  If you're looking for promotion to Wizard or Honorary Wizard, he's your man.  His room is right through the door behind me."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1387
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:482
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Would you like a membership to the School of Sorcery Scroll Shop?\nA membership allows you free access to the scrolls available in our library.\nIt costs 5000 gold for a six month membership, but the shop stocks once per week."
msgstr "Would you like a membership to the School of Sorcery Scroll Shop?  A membership allows you free access to the scrolls available in our library.  It costs 5000 gold for a six month membership, but the shop stocks once per week."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1388
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:483
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Here's the membership, remember it only lasts for six months.\nCheck the shelves in the front rooms here to see what is available."
msgstr "Here's the membership, remember it only lasts for six months.  Check the shelves in the front rooms here to see what is available."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1389
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:484
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You don't have enough gold-- it's no use trying to fool a Wizard."
msgstr "You don't have enough gold-- it's no use trying to fool a Wizard."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1390
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:485
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You want to bury the bones of Zokarr IV in our old barrows?\nNo dwarf here will brave the dangers, but Zokarr deserves to be laid to rest in the right place.\nLook for the secret barrow, the one with only one entrance.\nIn there is a coffin waiting for Zokarr's bones."
msgstr "You want to bury the bones of Zokarr IV in our old barrows?  No dwarf here will brave the dangers, but Zokarr deserves to be laid to rest in the right place.  Look for the secret barrow, the one with only one entrance.  In there is a coffin waiting for Zokarr's bones."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1391
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:486
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "We have no one to turn to but you, the new Lords of Harmondale. The Lantern of Light is a treasured holy relic, used by the temples of Erathia.\nIts value is more symbolic than of power-- without it the temples servants lose faith.\nThis Lantern disappeared while being brought to this temple from the temple in Stone City.\nWe believe it was lost somewhere in the maze-like Barrows.\nPlease find it and return it to us."
msgstr "We have no one to turn to but you, the new Lords of Harmondale. The Lantern of Light is a treasured holy relic, used by the temples of Erathia.  Its value is more symbolic than of power-- without it the temples servants lose faith.  This Lantern disappeared while being brought to this temple from the temple in Stone City.  We believe it was lost somewhere in the maze-like Barrows.  Please find it and return it to us."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1392
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:487
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Have you found the Lantern of Light?\nWe're certain it was lost in the maze of Barrows in the Barrow Downs."
msgstr "Have you found the Lantern of Light?  We're certain it was lost in the maze of Barrows in the Barrow Downs."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1393
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:488
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you, Lords of Harmondale.\nThe Lantern's return will bolster our faith and allows us to continue our services.\nPlease take this small reward as a token of our gratitude."
msgstr "Thank you, Lords of Harmondale.  The Lantern's return will bolster our faith and allows us to continue our services.  Please take this small reward as a token of our gratitude."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1394
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:489
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My, brother, Haldar passed away last month.\nThe family was sending his remains to me to be put to final rest.\nSomething happened to those delivering these remains to me; they disappeared in Nighon and not been heard from since. I fear my brothers soul will never rest unless they are found!\nPlease return Haldar to me if you find him? I will reward you well for this!"
msgstr "My, brother, Haldar passed away last month.  The family was sending his remains to me to be put to final rest.  Something happened to those delivering these remains to me; they disappeared in Nighon and not been heard from since. I fear my brothers soul will never rest unless they are found!  Please return Haldar to me if you find him? I will reward you well for this!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1395
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:490
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Did you find Haldar's Remains?\nHis soul must be in sheer agony!\nPlease find the jar with his remains!"
msgstr "Did you find Haldar's Remains?  His soul must be in sheer agony!  Please find the jar with his remains!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1396
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:491
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you for returning my \"brother's\" remains!\nHe was a promising Warlock and his life was ended to soon.\nNow that I have his remains, I will attempt to bring him back as a Lich, and together we will seek greater power and glory!"
msgstr "Thank you for returning my \"brother's\" remains!  He was a promising Warlock and his life was ended to soon.  Now that I have his remains, I will attempt to bring him back as a Lich, and together we will seek greater power and glory!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1397
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:492
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My lords, I was beset by foul bandits when I returned from Avlee and they took everything I had brought with me from the Elves.\nThey even took my signet ring!\nWithout it I cannot continue my business because I cannot seal contracts between myself and other merchants.\nI've heard the bandits base themselves out of a camp in Erathia, but I'm no warrior-- I'd not last a minute against them.\nPlease go to Erathia and see this justice done!"
msgstr "My lords, I was beset by foul bandits when I returned from Avlee and they took everything I had brought with me from the Elves.  They even took my signet ring!  Without it I cannot continue my business because I cannot seal contracts between myself and other merchants.  I've heard the bandits base themselves out of a camp in Erathia, but I'm no warrior-- I'd not last a minute against them.  Please go to Erathia and see this justice done!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1398
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:493
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You don't have my ring yet?\nThe bandits are south of Castle Gryphonheart in Erathia.\nPlease help me, I don't have anyone else to turn to."
msgstr "You don't have my ring yet?  The bandits are south of Castle Gryphonheart in Erathia.  Please help me, I don't have anyone else to turn to."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1399
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:494
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My ring!\nThank you lords.\nI can now continue my business and recover my losses, and you have made the trading routes safer for all the merchants!"
msgstr "My ring!  Thank you lords.  I can now continue my business and recover my losses, and you have made the trading routes safer for all the merchants!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1400
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:495
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So you are the Lords of Harmondale, eh?\nYou don’t look like much; we shall see how history judges you!\nI myself am a historian and collector of rare historical items.\nLord Markham also collects such items of interest and there is one item in particular that would complete my collection, Parson's Quill-- the Quill used to sign the Treaty of Pierpont ending the first Timber War.\nI know you have dealt with Lord Markham before, it's how you became Lords of this land after all, and if you would take this letter to Lord Markham in Tatalia, I'm sure he would respond favorably.\nI would be even more in your debt if Lord Markham sends this item back with you!\nI would be sure to favorably record your heroic acts and deeds!"
msgstr "So you are the Lords of Harmondale, eh?  You don稚 look like much; we shall see how history judges you!  I myself am a historian and collector of rare historical items.  Lord Markham also collects such items of interest and there is one item in particular that would complete my collection, Parson's Quill-- the Quill used to sign the Treaty of Pierpont ending the first Timber War.  I know you have dealt with Lord Markham before, it's how you became Lords of this land after all, and if you would take this letter to Lord Markham in Tatalia, I'm sure he would respond favorably.  I would be even more in your debt if Lord Markham sends this item back with you!  I would be sure to favorably record your heroic acts and deeds!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1401
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:496
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Did Lord Markham refuse to give you the Quill, or have you not even visited him yet?\nHis Manor is in Tatalia, please don't forget to help me."
msgstr "Did Lord Markham refuse to give you the Quill, or have you not even visited him yet?  His Manor is in Tatalia, please don't forget to help me."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1402
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:497
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The actual Peacock feather that was used to sign the Treaty of Pierpont.\nMy collection is complete!\nI will be sure to record your activities and deeds correctly and justly so that all will know you as the true Lords of Harmondale!"
msgstr "The actual Peacock feather that was used to sign the Treaty of Pierpont.  My collection is complete!  I will be sure to record your activities and deeds correctly and justly so that all will know you as the true Lords of Harmondale!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1403
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:498
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A letter from Norbert Thrush the Historian? Let me see it.\n[Lord Markham scans the letter briefly] Hmmmmm…he wants the Peacock feather that was used to sign the Treaty of Pierpont, does he.\nWell, seeing as though he has a supposed original of the Treaty, I guess the feather should go to him.\nHe has promised me anything else in his collection.\nTake this to him and tell him that I will come collect from him shortly!"
msgstr "A letter from Norbert Thrush the Historian? Let me see it.  [Lord Markham scans the letter briefly] Hmmmmm�he wants the Peacock feather that was used to sign the Treaty of Pierpont, does he.  Well, seeing as though he has a supposed original of the Treaty, I guess the feather should go to him.  He has promised me anything else in his collection.  Take this to him and tell him that I will come collect from him shortly!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1404
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:499
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I hear you folk are the new Lords of Harmondale, eh?\nPerhaps you could do me a large favor, and help yourselves in the process.\nTo the north, in Avlee, lies the Hall under the Hill, the domain of the Faerie King.\nHe owes me a debt from a previous service of mine, and I would like to collect it.\nUnfortunately, the faeries in the Hall and the tricks they play frighten me to death.\nIf you would deliver this letter to the Faerie King, and return what he gives you to me, I'd be very grateful.\nYou would also have the chance to meet the Faerie King for yourselves."
msgstr "I hear you folk are the new Lords of Harmondale, eh?  Perhaps you could do me a large favor, and help yourselves in the process.  To the north, in Avlee, lies the Hall under the Hill, the domain of the Faerie King.  He owes me a debt from a previous service of mine, and I would like to collect it.  Unfortunately, the faeries in the Hall and the tricks they play frighten me to death.  If you would deliver this letter to the Faerie King, and return what he gives you to me, I'd be very grateful.  You would also have the chance to meet the Faerie King for yourselves."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1405
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:500
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Excellent!\nThe Pipes!\nYou don't know what this means to me.\nHere, take this as a reward and thank you again for your help in this!"
msgstr "Excellent!  The Pipes!  You don't know what this means to me.  Here, take this as a reward and thank you again for your help in this!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1406
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:501
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Don't forget to give the letter to the Faerie King.\nWithout it, he probably won't even want to talk to you."
msgstr "Don't forget to give the letter to the Faerie King.  Without it, he probably won't even want to talk to you."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1407
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:502
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "We request your services for only one small task.\nIn Castle Lambent rests a valuable tapestry taken from an attack on Watchtower 3 years ago.\nI would like you to get the tapestry for me, as you must have *some* access to the Castle-- my normal associates can't even come near the place.\nI hear a large band of goblins and renegade swordsmen are about... it would be a shame if they happened to find a way to Harmondale.\nYou have one month to get the tapestry.\nDon't be late."
msgstr "We request your services for only one small task.  In Castle Lambent rests a valuable tapestry taken from an attack on Watchtower 3 years ago.  I would like you to get the tapestry for me, as you must have *some* access to the Castle-- my normal associates can't even come near the place.  I hear a large band of goblins and renegade swordsmen are about... it would be a shame if they happened to find a way to Harmondale.  You have one month to get the tapestry.  Don't be late."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1408
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:503
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "We request your services for one task.\nA rare and valuable tapestry rests in Castle Gloaming, an antique from near the Silence stolen from the wizards some time ago.\nI would like you to get the tapestry for me, as my normal associates don't have access to Castle Gloaming.\nIn return, I'll make sure that the large band of renegade swordsmen and goblins near Harmondale don't accidentally stumble upon your quiet, little village.\nYou have one month; don't be late."
msgstr "We request your services for one task.  A rare and valuable tapestry rests in Castle Gloaming, an antique from near the Silence stolen from the wizards some time ago.  I would like you to get the tapestry for me, as my normal associates don't have access to Castle Gloaming.  In return, I'll make sure that the large band of renegade swordsmen and goblins near Harmondale don't accidentally stumble upon your quiet, little village.  You have one month; don't be late."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1409
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:504
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Excellent!\nI see that you can be trusted to perform well when called upon.\nI'll keep that in mind the next time I need a job done.\nYour reward is nothing more than status quo-- things could be much worse than they already are.\nGo now, I have no more time for you."
msgstr "Excellent!  I see that you can be trusted to perform well when called upon.  I'll keep that in mind the next time I need a job done.  Your reward is nothing more than status quo-- things could be much worse than they already are.  Go now, I have no more time for you."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1410
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:505
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I see.\nWell, it would appear that the band of renegades has indeed discovered your little town, and has begun looting.\nYou may find your bank account a little, well, pinched.\nConsider this a lesson in punctuality.\nGo now and have a pleasant, pleasant day."
msgstr "I see.  Well, it would appear that the band of renegades has indeed discovered your little town, and has begun looting.  You may find your bank account a little, well, pinched.  Consider this a lesson in punctuality.  Go now and have a pleasant, pleasant day."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1411
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:506
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A few years back, while mining underneath Stone City, we came upon quite a shock.\nIt seems that the Warlocks from Nighon had burrowed under the sea to make a sneak attack upon the shores of Erathia.\nTheir careless tunneling has sunken the earth around here until now the areas around the old dwarven barrows and, of course, Stone City, rest far above the terrain.\nWe discovered a force of troglodytes in our mining areas, with a tunnel leading back to Nighon.\nIf you could help us by ridding the tunnels of the troglodytes, we could get back to mining.\nCan you help us?"
msgstr "A few years back, while mining underneath Stone City, we came upon quite a shock.  It seems that the Warlocks from Nighon had burrowed under the sea to make a sneak attack upon the shores of Erathia.  Their careless tunneling has sunken the earth around here until now the areas around the old dwarven barrows and, of course, Stone City, rest far above the terrain.  We discovered a force of troglodytes in our mining areas, with a tunnel leading back to Nighon.  If you could help us by ridding the tunnels of the troglodytes, we could get back to mining.  Can you help us?"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1412
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:507
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There are still troglodytes roaming the lower mine levels.\nPlease remove them!"
msgstr "There are still troglodytes roaming the lower mine levels.  Please remove them!"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1413
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:508
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "They're gone?\nRouted back into the connecting tunnels to Nighon!\nExcellent!\nWe can get back to mining immediately!\nThank you so much for your help; take this as a reward for your services."
msgstr "They're gone?  Routed back into the connecting tunnels to Nighon!  Excellent!  We can get back to mining immediately!  Thank you so much for your help; take this as a reward for your services."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1414
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:509
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I have recently gained information that the forces of Queen Catherine, in Erathia, have begun to build a force to attack Deyja.\nBecause of the difficult terrain, they have begun to breed and train griffins to assist in their attack.\nThese griffins are being raised in both Erathia and the Bracada Desert.\nI need you to kill off all the griffins in those two areas so that the Erathians will be forced to drastically delay their plans of attack."
msgstr "I have recently gained information that the forces of Queen Catherine, in Erathia, have begun to build a force to attack Deyja.  Because of the difficult terrain, they have begun to breed and train griffins to assist in their attack.  These griffins are being raised in both Erathia and the Bracada Desert.  I need you to kill off all the griffins in those two areas so that the Erathians will be forced to drastically delay their plans of attack."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1415
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:510
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You haven't killed off all the griffins in either Erathia or the Bracada Desert.\nIt is imperative that you finish this task to prevent their invasion."
msgstr "You haven't killed off all the griffins in either Erathia or the Bracada Desert.  It is imperative that you finish this task to prevent their invasion."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1416
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:511
msgctxt "npc conversation"
