msgstr "I can lend my considerable magic reserves to sharply increase your Elemental spell skills and effects for the low, low price of 2000 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:24
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:24
