msgstr "Six point bonus to Merchant skill for all characters.  %01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:25
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "As a long time member of the Merchant's Guild, and a former rug merchant myself, I know all the tricks of the trade like the back of my hand.  I can give you advice while bargaining with other Merchants to improve the prices you get.  My fee is but 200 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "As a long time member of the Merchant's Guild, and a former rug merchant myself, I know all the tricks of the trade like the back of my hand.  I can give you advice while bargaining with other Merchants to improve the prices you get.  My fee is but 200 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:26
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:26
