msgstr "Who will warn you of danger if not me?  You're making a big mistake, boss!"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:27
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Four point bonus to Alchemy skill for all characters.  %01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "Four point bonus to Alchemy skill for all characters.  %01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:27
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "In my studies I've gathered quite a knowledge of reagents and catalysts.  I'm sure I could assist you in creating and mixing potions, if you'll only hire me.  400 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "In my studies I've gathered quite a knowledge of reagents and catalysts.  I'm sure I could assist you in creating and mixing potions, if you'll only hire me.  400 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."

