msgstr "Five point bonus to Luck statistic for all characters.  %01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:31
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcprof.txt.py:31
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "The gods favor drunks, children and fools.  Well, I'm a fool!  Take me with you and maybe the gods will favor you too.  All I want is 100 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "The gods favor drunks, children and fools.  Well, I'm a fool!  Take me with you and maybe the gods will favor you too.  All I want is 100 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."

