msgstr "With Expert Light Magic you can learn all of the Expert spells for this element.  Higher Level spells may prove more potent and of greater assistance to your party.  Expert Light Magic can be yours if you have a skill level of 4 in Light Magic and can pay the price of 2000 gold."

