msgid "Mace skill covers all kinds of blunt trauma weapons ranging from batons to flails.  Expert mace swingers do extra damage with their weapons while master ranking gives a chance to stun opponents."
msgstr "Mace skill covers all kinds of blunt trauma weapons ranging from batons to flails.  Expert mace swingers do extra damage with their weapons while master ranking gives a chance to stun opponents."

